<title>USA: HNC licenses security software to Sears.</title>
<headline>HNC licenses security software to Sears.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>HNC Software Inc on Tuesday said that Sears, Roebuck and Co has signed a letter of agreement to license HNC's payment card fraud detection system.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The system, named Falcon Retail, can determine the probability of fraud with each credit card transaction, HNC says. When the probability of fraud reaches a critical threshold, Falcon Retail will send the case to one of the retailer's fraud analysts for action.</p>
</text>
